- Added payout ledger orchestration with new models, repositories, and schema migration so consignor balances track pending/available funds and entries per transaction (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/PayoutLedgerService.java:1`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/data/models/PayoutLedger.java:1`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/data/models/PayoutLedgerEntry.java:1`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/resources/db/migrations/V20260118__payout_ledger_tables.sql:1`).
- Extended consignment flows to normalize commission rates, attribute paid/refunded orders to consignors, and update ledger/inventory status with supporting repository queries (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/ConsignmentService.java:257`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/data/repositories/ConsignmentItemRepository.java:34`).
- Order/payment services now stamp vendor metadata on line items and invoke ledger hooks on payment/refund events (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/OrderService.java:142`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/PaymentService.java:50` and `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/PaymentService.java:216`).
- Documented the payout ledger workflow and added coverage for new behaviors, tenant isolation, and consignment metadata propagation (`docs/consignment-payout-ledger.md:1`, `modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/PayoutLedgerServiceTest.java:46`, `modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/PayoutLedgerRLSTest.java:52`, `modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/ConsignmentServiceTest.java:199`, `modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/OrderServiceTest.java:170`).
- Tests: `./mvnw -pl modules/core-platform -Dtest=ConsignmentServiceTest,PayoutLedgerServiceTest,PayoutLedgerRLSTest,OrderServiceTest test`

